      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-27T07:25:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for information. Some sophisticated logging systems handle the uninterpolated format string differently. Avoid using f-string reduce the risk of producing error in this case makes sense.",
